  "Aumentados y disminuidos": "Augmented and diminished",
  "Aumentados, disminuidos y armaduras en el instrumento: el tritono se encuentra y se resuelve, y cada armadura del círculo de quintas tiene su escala.": "Augmented and diminished intervals, and key signatures on the instrument: the tritone is found and resolved, and each key signature in the circle of fifths has its scale.",
  "Austria (Viena)": "Austria (Vienna)",
  "Años después, Franz Schubert (el compositor de «El zanfonista», unidad 2) puso música al mismo poema, y la suya es hoy la más famosa.": "Years later, Franz Schubert (the composer of “The Hurdy-Gurdy Man”, unit 2) set the same poem to music, and his version is the most famous today.",
  "Bagatela para piano": "Bagatelle for piano",
  "Baila, baila, salta el pulso; suena, suena, ligadura. Cuenta, cuenta, uno y dos; baila, baila, todo el mundo, ¡baila ya!": "Dance, dance, leap along upon the beat; sound it, sound it, tied note over. Count now, count now, one and two; dance now, dance now, everyone, come and dance right now!",
  "Baja con la y sol naturales y sube con sol♯ y la♯: melódica.": "It descends with natural A and G and ascends with G♯ and A♯: melodic.",
